3. MANDATORY NOTIFICATION
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

If You fork, clone with intent to modify, create a Derivative Work from,
deploy, or host The Software or any Derivative Work, You must notify The
Author in writing within thirty (30) days of first such action.

The notification must include:

  (i)   Your legal name or GitHub username (or both);
  (ii)  a URL pointing to Your fork or Derivative Work, where applicable;
  (iii) a brief, good-faith description of how You are using or intend to
        use The Software or the Derivative Work;
  (iv)  Your contact email address.

Notification is satisfied by any ONE of the following methods:

  - An email to filo.gametech@gmail.com with the subject line beginning
    "[FOODIY-FSAL]".
  - Opening a GitHub issue at
    https://github.com/Cyberfilo/foodiy/issues with the title beginning
    "[FSAL Notification]" and containing the information above.

If You materially change how You use The Software (for example, from
personal tinkering to a hosted deployment for a group), You must send a
supplemental notification within thirty (30) days of the change.

